<title>USA: Atlantic sees no reason for stock movement.</title>
<headline>Atlantic sees no reason for stock movement.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-03-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atlantic International Entertainment Ltd said it knows of no reason for the recent significant drop in its share price and the relatively heavy trading volume of the last two weeks.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement, issued late Friday, that it believes it is successfully continuing to implement its business plan.</p>
<p>The shares fell 1-5/32 to close Friday at 1-23/32.</p>
